Quality sensors / Sensores de qualidade
---------------------------------------

The Node scripts under scripts/ named sensor-report.mjs, sensor-guides.mjs,
guides/*.mjs, docs-sensor.mjs, gitleaks-sensor.mjs, git-changes.mjs and
sensors-doctor.mjs, and the comment and test rules of the Java analyser in
scripts/kof-sensors/, are adapted from Katacombs (katacombs-kata-ts, commit
44cb39c916e9a05de561123d7b13554ee6e0a516), distributed under the MIT License
reproduced below.

Adaptations: the ESLint, jscpd and TypeScript tooling were replaced by the
official Kof lexer and parser plus PMD CPD 7.17.0 (scripts/kof-sensors/);
guide texts that cited TypeScript, ESLint or it.each were rewritten for Kof
(for example testRows from kof.test); docs-sensor accepts a project root and
resolves links written as path:line to their file; gitleaks-sensor writes its
temporary report outside the repository; sensors-doctor reports the Kof,
KofMut, Node, Maven, Java and Gitleaks tools of this project; code comments
were removed to follow AGENTS.md.

Os scripts Node acima e as regras de comentário e de teste do analisador
Java foram adaptados do Katacombs, sob a licença MIT abaixo. As adaptações
estão descritas no parágrafo anterior.

